{{!
    @template tool_lp/user_evidence_list_page

    A user's evidence of prior learning as one dated list, with the platform's records beside it once the
    script runs, under a bar of scope, count, Filters, period and search, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/user_evidence_list_page of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/user_evidence_list_page.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every core upgrade.

    It renders from core's context alone: that is what tool_lp/user_evidence_actions hands it on the client after
    every action (delete, link competencies, send for review), when it replaces the region whole with
    templates.replaceNode() and runs this template's js block again. The theme's first paint adds keys of its
    own (dimfirstpaint, dimplatform, and per evidence dimmonthhead, from
    theme_dimensions\output\tool_lp_renderer, which also puts the evidence newest first);
    theme_dimensions/competencyevidence, started from the js block, sorts and groups the list by month after a
    re-render, adds the platform's records from theme_dimensions_get_user_evidence_feed, runs the bar and opens
    the selected evidence beside the list.

    Kept from core: the root data-region="user-evidence-list" (replaced whole), one
    data-region='user-evidence-node' per evidence with data-id and data-userid (the one ancestor
    _findEvidenceData reads), the menu's structure ul.user-evidence-actions > li > a[href="#"] +
    ul.dropdown.dropdown-menu > li.dropdown-item under canmanage, its edit link and its three actions
    (link-competency under userhasplan, send-competencies-review, user-evidence-delete), the evidence's link to
    user_evidence.php, its URL and files, its competencies with their status and reviewer, the navigation
    buttons, the list's caption as a heading, the nouserevidence message, core's two js lines, the name
    triple-stashed as core prints it.
    Changed: a dated list in place of the table; each evidence's date (core's timecreated), its competencies'
    ids and its month as attributes; the menu is the item's kebab, named "Actions for" the evidence in visually
    hidden text; the detail beside the list is copied by the script from a template element of each item, whose
    buttons press the item's own menu entries, so core's handlers stay the only ones; a hidden bar, a hidden
    side panel, a loading line and the button that loads older records, all revealed by the script.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * userid - The ID of the user whose page we're viewing
    * canmanage - Whether the current user can manage the evidence
    * evidence - The list of evidence, core's user_evidence_summary_exporter
    * navigation - Buttons to add to the page
    * pluginbaseurl - The plugin base URL

    Example context (json):
    {
        "userid": 3,
        "canmanage": true,
        "pluginbaseurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp",
        "navigation": [
            "<a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/lp/user_evidence_edit.php?userid=3\">Add new evidence</a>"
        ],
        "dimfirstpaint": true,
        "dimplatform": true,
        "evidence": [
            {
                "id": 7,
                "userid": 3,
                "name": "Data protection certificate",
                "description": "<p>Eight hours, with exercises.</p>",
                "url": "https://example.com/certificates/8841",
                "urlshort": "example.com/certificates/8841",
                "timecreated": 1792065600,
                "canmanage": true,
                "userhasplan": true,
                "hasurlorfiles": true,
                "filecount": 1,
                "files": [
                    {
                        "filename": "certificate.pdf",
                        "filenameshort": "certificate.pdf",
                        "filesizeformatted": "240 KB",
                        "icon": "f/pdf",
                        "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/5/core_competency/userevidence/7/certificate.pdf"
                    }
                ],
                "competencycount": 1,
                "usercompetencies": [
                    {
                        "competency": {
                            "id": 12,
                            "shortname": "Data protection",
                            "idnumber": "2.3"
                        },
                        "usercompetency": {
                            "id": 40,
                            "statusname": "Waiting for review",
                            "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp/user_competency.php?id=40",
                            "reviewer": {
                                "fullname": "Renato Dias"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "dimmonthhead": "October 2026"
            },
            {
                "id": 8,
                "userid": 3,
                "name": "Accessible materials",
                "description": "",
                "url": "",
                "urlshort": "",
                "timecreated": 1789473600,
                "canmanage": true,
                "userhasplan": false,
                "hasurlorfiles": false,
                "filecount": 0,
                "files": [],
                "competencycount": 0,
                "usercompetencies": [],
                "dimmonthhead": "September 2026"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="user-evidence-list" class="dim-comp-ev" data-dim-userid="{{userid}}"{{#dimfirstpaint}} data-dim-firstpaint="1"{{!
    }} data-dim-platform="{{#dimplatform}}1{{/dimplatform}}{{^dimplatform}}0{{/dimplatform}}"{{/dimfirstpaint}}>
    <div class="dim-comp-plans-head">
        {{#navigation}}
        {{{.}}}
        {{/navigation}}
    </div>

    <div class="dim-comp-bar" data-region="dim-comp-bar" hidden>
        <div class="dim-comp-seg" role="radiogroup" data-region="dim-comp-scope" aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidencescope, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
            <button type="button" class="dim-comp-seg-cell" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" data-value="all">
                {{#str}} competency_evidencescope_all, theme_dimensions {{/str}} <small data-region="dim-comp-scope-count"></small>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="dim-comp-seg-cell" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="prior">
                {{#str}} competency_evidencescope_prior, theme_dimensions {{/str}} <small data-region="dim-comp-scope-count"></small>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="dim-comp-seg-cell" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="platform">
                {{#str}} competency_evidencescope_platform, theme_dimensions {{/str}} <small data-region="dim-comp-scope-count"></small>
            </button>
        </div>
        <span class="dim-comp-bar-spacer"></span>
        <div class="dim-comp-bar-cluster" data-region="dim-comp-cluster">
            <span class="dim-comp-bar-count" data-region="dim-comp-total" aria-live="polite"></span>
            <div class="dim-comp-capsule dim-comp-tools" data-region="dim-comp-tools">
                <button type="button" class="dim-comp-iconbtn dim-comp-tip" data-action="dim-comp-filters" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="{{uniqid}}-dim-filters" aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidencefilters, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                        data-dim-comp-tip="{{#str}} competency_evidencefilters, theme_dimensions {{/str}}" hidden>
                    {{#pix}} i/filter, core {{/pix}}<span class="dim-comp-badge" data-region="dim-comp-badge" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="dim-comp-iconbtn dim-comp-tip" data-action="dim-comp-ev-period" aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="{{uniqid}}-dim-period" aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                        data-dim-comp-tip="{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
                    <i class="fa fa-calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="dim-comp-ev-perioddot" data-region="dim-comp-ev-perioddot" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-comp-capsule dim-comp-search" data-region="dim-comp-search">
            <button type="button" class="dim-comp-iconbtn dim-comp-tip" data-action="dim-comp-search-open"
                    aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidencesearch, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                    data-dim-comp-tip="{{#str}} competency_evidencesearch, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
                {{#pix}} i/search, core {{/pix}}
            </button>
            <span class="dim-comp-search-field" hidden>
                {{#pix}} i/search, core {{/pix}}
                <input type="search" class="dim-comp-search-input" autocomplete="off"
                       aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidencesearch, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                       placeholder="{{#str}} competency_evidencesearch, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
                <button type="button" class="dim-comp-eraser dim-comp-tip" data-action="dim-comp-search-clear"
                        aria-label="{{#str}} category_searchclear, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                        data-dim-comp-tip="{{#str}} category_searchclear, theme_dimensions {{/str}}" hidden>
                    {{#pix}} e/clear_formatting, core {{/pix}}
                </button>
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-comp-fpanel" id="{{uniqid}}-dim-filters" data-region="dim-comp-fpanel" hidden>
            <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-body" data-region="dim-comp-fpanel-body"></div>
            <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-foot">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-action="dim-comp-clearfilters">
                    {{#str}} competency_evidenceclearfilters, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" data-action="dim-comp-show">
                    {{#str}} competency_evidenceshow, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-comp-fpanel dim-comp-ev-periodlayer" id="{{uniqid}}-dim-period" role="group" data-region="dim-comp-ev-periodlayer"
             aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod, theme_dimensions {{/str}}" hidden>
            <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-body">
                <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-head" id="{{uniqid}}-dim-periodhead">{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</div>
                <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-opts" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{uniqid}}-dim-periodhead">
                    <button type="button" class="dim-comp-fpanel-opt" aria-pressed="false" data-dim-quick="month">
                        {{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod_month, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="dim-comp-fpanel-opt" aria-pressed="false" data-dim-quick="quarter">
                        {{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod_quarter, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="dim-comp-fpanel-opt" aria-pressed="false" data-dim-quick="year">
                        {{#str}} competency_evidenceperiod_year, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="dim-comp-ev-boxes">
                    <label class="dim-comp-ev-box">
                        <span class="dim-comp-ev-boxlabel">{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiodfrom, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
                        <input type="date" class="dim-comp-ev-date" data-region="dim-comp-ev-from">
                    </label>
                    <label class="dim-comp-ev-box">
                        <span class="dim-comp-ev-boxlabel">{{#str}} competency_evidenceperiodto, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
                        <input type="date" class="dim-comp-ev-date" data-region="dim-comp-ev-to">
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-comp-fpanel-foot">
                <button type="button" class="dim-comp-clearall" data-action="dim-comp-ev-periodclear">
                    {{#str}} competency_evidenceperiodclear, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" data-action="dim-comp-ev-periodshow">
                    {{#str}} competency_evidenceshow, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-comp-chips" data-region="dim-comp-chips" hidden></div>
    </div>

    <div class="dim-comp-ev-layout">
        <div class="dim-comp-ev-main">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}listofevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}</h3>
            <ol class="dim-comp-ev-list" data-region="dim-comp-ev-list">
                {{#evidence}}
                {{#dimmonthhead}}
                <li class="dim-comp-ev-month" data-region="dim-comp-ev-month"><h3 class="dim-comp-ev-monthtitle">{{dimmonthhead}}</h3></li>
                {{/dimmonthhead}}
                <li data-region='user-evidence-node' data-id="{{id}}" data-userid="{{userid}}" class="dim-comp-ev-item"
                    data-dim-kind="prior" data-dim-key="p{{id}}" data-dim-time="{{timecreated}}"
                    data-dim-month="{{#userdate}} {{timecreated}}, %Y-%m {{/userdate}}"
                    data-dim-monthlabel="{{#userdate}} {{timecreated}}, {{#str}} strftimemonthyear, core_langconfig {{/str}} {{/userdate}}"
                    data-dim-comps="{{#usercompetencies}}{{competency.id}} {{/usercompetencies}}">
                    <span class="dim-comp-ev-when">{{#userdate}} {{timecreated}}, {{#str}} strftimedateshort, core_langconfig {{/str}} {{/userdate}}</span>
                    <span class="dim-comp-ev-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dim-comp-ev-dot"></span></span>
                    <div class="dim-comp-ev-card">
                        <span class="dim-comp-ev-kind dim-comp-ev-kind--prior" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-file-lines"></i></span>
                        <div class="dim-comp-ev-text">
                            <div class="dim-comp-ev-top">
                                <span class="dim-comp-ev-src">{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_prior, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
                                {{^competencycount}}
                                <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--status">{{#str}} competency_evidencenolink, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
                                {{/competencycount}}
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="dim-comp-ev-title"><a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/user_evidence.php?id={{id}}" data-action="dim-comp-ev-open">{{{name}}}</a></h4>
                            {{#competencycount}}
                            <ul class="dim-comp-ev-feeds user-evidence-competencies">
                                {{#usercompetencies}}
                                <li>{{{competency.shortname}}} <span class="dim-comp-muted">{{usercompetency.statusname}}{{#usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}} / {{usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}}{{/usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}}</span></li>
                                {{/usercompetencies}}
                            </ul>
                            {{/competencycount}}
                        </div>
                        {{#canmanage}}
                        <div class="dim-comp-plan-menu">
                        <ul class="user-evidence-actions">
                        <li>
                            <a href="#" class="dim-comp-plan-menu-trigger dim-comp-tip">
                                {{#pix}} i/menu, core {{/pix}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}} competency_evidenceactions, theme_dimensions, {{{name}}} {{/str}}</span>
                            </a>
                            <ul class="dropdown dropdown-menu">
                                <li class="dropdown-item">
                                    <a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/user_evidence_edit.php?id={{id}}&amp;userid={{userid}}&amp;return=list">
                                        {{#pix}}t/edit{{/pix}} {{#str}}editthisuserevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                {{#userhasplan}}
                                <li class="dropdown-item">
                                    <a href="#" data-action="link-competency">
                                        {{#pix}}t/add{{/pix}} {{#str}}linkcompetencies, tool_lp{{/str}}
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                {{/userhasplan}}
                                <li class="dropdown-item">
                                    <a data-action="send-competencies-review" href="#">
                                        {{#pix}}t/edit{{/pix}} {{#str}}sendcompetenciestoreview, tool_lp{{/str}}
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="dropdown-item">
                                    <a data-action="user-evidence-delete" href="#">
                                        {{#pix}}t/delete{{/pix}} {{#str}}deletethisuserevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        </ul>
                        </div>
                        {{/canmanage}}
                    </div>
                    <template data-region="dim-comp-ev-detailsrc">
                        <p class="dim-comp-ev-detail-meta">{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_prior, theme_dimensions {{/str}} · {{#userdate}} {{timecreated}}, {{#str}} strftimedate, core_langconfig {{/str}} {{/userdate}}</p>
                        <h3 class="dim-comp-ev-detail-title">{{{name}}}</h3>
                        <div class="dim-comp-ev-detail-desc">{{{description}}}</div>
                        {{#url}}
                        <dl class="dim-comp-ev-facts">
                            <dt>{{#str}} competency_evidenceaddress, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</dt>
                            <dd><a href="{{url}}" title="{{url}}">{{urlshort}}</a></dd>
                        </dl>
                        {{/url}}
                        {{#filecount}}
                        <h4 class="dim-comp-ev-detail-sub">{{#str}} userevidencefiles, tool_lp {{/str}}</h4>
                        <ul class="dim-comp-ev-files user-evidence-documents">
                            {{#files}}
                            <li>{{#pix}}{{icon}}{{/pix}} <a href="{{url}}" title="{{filename}}">{{filenameshort}}</a></li>
                            {{/files}}
                        </ul>
                        {{/filecount}}
                        <h4 class="dim-comp-ev-detail-sub">{{#str}} linkedcompetencies, tool_lp {{/str}}</h4>
                        {{#competencycount}}
                        <ul class="dim-comp-ev-detail-comps">
                            {{#usercompetencies}}
                            <li>
                                <a href="{{usercompetency.url}}">{{{competency.shortname}}}</a>
                                <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--status">{{usercompetency.statusname}}</span>
                                {{#usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}}<span class="dim-comp-muted">{{usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}}</span>{{/usercompetency.reviewer.fullname}}
                            </li>
                            {{/usercompetencies}}
                        </ul>
                        {{/competencycount}}
                        {{^competencycount}}
                        <p class="dim-comp-muted">{{#str}} competency_evidencenolink, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
                        {{/competencycount}}
                        {{#canmanage}}
                        <div class="dim-comp-ev-detail-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/user_evidence_edit.php?id={{id}}&amp;userid={{userid}}&amp;return=list">{{#str}} editthisuserevidence, tool_lp {{/str}}</a>
                            {{#userhasplan}}
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-dim-ev-proxy="link-competency">{{#str}} linkcompetencies, tool_lp {{/str}}</button>
                            {{/userhasplan}}
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-dim-ev-proxy="send-competencies-review">{{#str}} sendcompetenciestoreview, tool_lp {{/str}}</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" data-dim-ev-proxy="user-evidence-delete">{{#str}} deletethisuserevidence, tool_lp {{/str}}</button>
                        </div>
                        {{/canmanage}}
                    </template>
                </li>
                {{/evidence}}
            </ol>
            {{^evidence}}
            <p class="dim-comp-plans-empty" data-region="dim-comp-ev-noprior">{{#str}}nouserevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
            {{/evidence}}
            <p class="dim-comp-plans-empty" data-region="dim-comp-ev-nomatch" hidden>{{#str}} competency_evidencenomatch, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
            <div class="dim-comp-ev-loading" data-region="dim-comp-ev-loading" hidden>
                <span class="dim-comp-ev-skeleton" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="dim-comp-ev-skeleton" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}} competency_evidenceloading, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="dim-comp-plans-empty" data-region="dim-comp-ev-failed" hidden>{{#str}} competency_evidencefailed, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
            <div class="dim-comp-ev-morerow">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-action="dim-comp-ev-more" hidden>
                    {{#str}} competency_evidencemore, theme_dimensions {{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="dim-comp-ev-detail" id="{{uniqid}}-dim-detail" data-region="dim-comp-ev-detail" tabindex="-1"
               aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidencedetail, theme_dimensions {{/str}}" hidden>
            <div class="dim-comp-ev-detail-head">
                <button type="button" class="dim-comp-iconbtn dim-comp-tip" data-action="dim-comp-ev-close"
                        aria-label="{{#str}} competency_evidenceclose, theme_dimensions {{/str}}"
                        data-dim-comp-tip="{{#str}} competency_evidenceclose, theme_dimensions {{/str}}">
                    <i class="fa fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-comp-ev-detail-body" data-region="dim-comp-ev-detailbody"></div>
        </aside>
    </div>

    {{#js}}
    require(['tool_lp/user_evidence_actions'], function(UserEvidenceActions) {
        var uea = new UserEvidenceActions('list');
        uea.enhanceMenubar('.user-evidence-actions');
    });
    require(['theme_dimensions/competencyevidence'], function(CompetencyEvidence) {
        CompetencyEvidence.init();
    });
    {{/js}}
</div>
